  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "オカルトざっしが　とりあげたみらいの　ビリジオンの　すがたとおおくの　とくちょうが　いっちする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오컬트 잡지에서 다뤘던 미래 비리디온의 모습과 많은 특징이 일치한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與超自然雜誌曾報導的未來的畢力吉翁的樣子有多項特徵一致。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il présente de nombreuses similitudes avec le Viridium du futur évoqué dans une revue sur les phénomènes paranormaux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Viele seiner Merkmale entsprechen denen eines Viridium aus der Zukunft, welches in einer esoterischen Zeitschrift vorgestellt wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Presenta numerosas características en común con el Virizion del futuro que apareció publicado en cierta revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha molte caratteristiche in comune con un Virizion del futuro citato in una rivista di paranormale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Many of its physical characteristics match those of a Virizion from the future that was covered in a paranormal magazine.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "オカルト雑誌が　取り上げた未来の　ビリジオンの　姿と多くの　特徴が　一致する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "与超自然杂志中介绍过的未来的毕力吉翁的样子有多个特征相吻合。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Presenta numerosas características en común con el Virizion del futuro que apareció publicado en cierta revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "わずかな　もくげきだんによるとひかりかがやく　つるぎで　たいぼくやおおいわを　なますぎりにしたという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "얼마 없는 목격담에 의하면 눈부시게 빛나는 검으로 큰 나무나 바위를 채 썰듯 베었다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "根據極少數的目擊紀錄，牠似乎用光輝燦爛的劍將大樹與巨岩切成了絲。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "D’après de rares témoins, il aurait coupé en lamelles des arbres et des rochers immenses à l’aide de ses épées lumineuses.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Einigen wenigen Augenzeugenberichten zufolge hat dieses Pokémon mit seinen leuchtenden Schwertern riesige Bäume und Felsen zerkleinert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Unos pocos testimonios afirman haberlo visto cortar en tiras árboles y rocas de gran tamaño mediante sus espadas luminosas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Secondo alcune testimonianze isolate, avrebbe fatto a fettine grandi alberi e rocce con delle spade luminose.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "According to the few eyewitness accounts that exist, it used its shining blades to julienne large trees and boulders.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "わずかな　目撃談によると光り輝く　剣で　大木や大岩を　なます切りにしたという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "根据极少的目击报告，它用散发着光辉的剑将大树和大石头切成了丝。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Unos pocos testimonios afirman haberlo visto cortar en tiras árboles y rocas de gran tamaño mediante sus espadas luminosas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
